WEBVTT

00:00:01.880 --> 00:00:05.300
This is the Microsoft for Education Daily, for Thursday.

00:00:06.560 --> 00:00:09.510
Let's catch you up on everything new from Microsoft.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:17.530
Learn by doing. At a Wisconsin college,

00:00:17.530 --> 00:00:21.620
a Microsoft Datacenter Academy trains data centre technicians.

00:00:22.030 --> 00:00:26.240
By May, 14 had the certificate, and 206 were enrolled.

00:00:31.880 --> 00:00:37.230
Microsoft-funded scholarships cover the tuition, about $2,300, and the books.

00:00:39.380 --> 00:00:43.670
Gateway's dean says it isn't really about steering graduates to Microsoft.

00:00:43.670 --> 00:00:45.410
It's for the whole community.

00:00:46.410 --> 00:00:51.960
Student coders? In VS Code, Claude can review a plan Copilot wrote, in preview.

00:00:52.970 --> 00:00:55.200
And when you need a break, there's Blobby,

00:00:55.200 --> 00:00:57.750
a little jumping game starring the VS Code pet.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:01.700
Staff meeting? In December,

00:01:01.700 --> 00:01:06.220
Teams' Facilitator is due to turn what was said into a PowerPoint deck.

00:01:07.500 --> 00:01:09.460
It works from the conversation,

00:01:09.460 --> 00:01:13.380
the meeting chat and shared files. It already drafts in Word.

00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:17.470
University IT building AI agents?

00:01:17.470 --> 00:01:22.120
Azure can now put MCP servers behind one gateway, in preview.

00:01:22.500 --> 00:01:25.610
And Azure Site Recovery's improved disaster recovery

00:01:25.610 --> 00:01:28.720
for flexible scale sets is now generally available.

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:35.240
Research storage piling up? Azure Storage Discovery now shows access patterns,

00:01:35.240 --> 00:01:37.380
data age and tiers, in preview.

00:01:37.500 --> 00:01:40.600
So you can see which data is old or rarely touched,

00:01:40.600 --> 00:01:42.550
and how much sits in each tier.

00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:46.910
The fine print? In preview,

00:01:46.910 --> 00:01:52.490
Azure SQL backups can stay locked for the full retention, not just seven days.

00:01:52.500 --> 00:01:59.770
And Application Insights API keys now retire on March 31, 2027. Switch to Entra.

00:02:01.880 --> 00:02:08.000
After hours? Escape Academy 2: Back 2 School is on Game Pass from November 5.

00:02:08.440 --> 00:02:13.570
Xbox's tips? Keep a pencil and paper handy, and think backwards from the goal.

00:02:15.000 --> 00:02:21.640
And Xbox's new Nano Controller is out: 101 grams, built for smaller hands.

00:02:22.500 --> 00:02:25.080
Hands-on courses, agents checking agents,

00:02:25.080 --> 00:02:28.670
pencil-and-paper puzzles: that's how you learn by doing.

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:33.020
Day after day, the updates keep stacking up.

00:02:33.750 --> 00:02:36.800
Check the board: shipped today, and more on the way.

00:02:37.500 --> 00:02:40.690
All of that, in one day. And it keeps on shipping.

00:02:45.000 --> 00:02:47.720
This has been the Microsoft for Education Daily.

00:02:48.750 --> 00:02:51.340
Go build something. See you tomorrow.
